Welcome to Veyra OS Live

Veyra OS — desktop and system rescue environment.

Quick commands:
  veyra status       System information
  veyra setup        Configuration wizard
  veyra storage      Inspect disks and partitions
  veyra repo status  Check the Veyra package repository
  veyra --help       Show all supported commands

The full disk installer is not implemented yet.
Do not use this image to install onto internal disks.
Use the NetworkManager icon in the desktop panel for network setup.
